experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum two (2) years experience working with data and integration technologies (e.g., ESB ETL, EAI).","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"preferred","item_text":"Two (2) years experience designing and/or implementing ecommerce applications.","source_heading":"Preferred Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum two (2) years experience translating solution requirements into technical application requirements.","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum two (2) years experience in the design of target state architecture in a corporate or enterprise environment.","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum two (2) years experience in solution architecture, including working with a portfolio of solutions.","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum two (2) years experience working with application development frameworks (e.g., Spring, Jersey, Oracle ADF).","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"experience","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum one (1) year experience with modeling techniques (e.g., BPMN, UML, ER).","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Completes work assignments and supports business-specific projects by applying expertise in subject area; supporting the development of work plans to meet business priorities and deadlines; ensuring team follows all procedures and policies; coordinating and assigning resources to accomplish priorities and deadlines; collaborating cross-functionally to make effective business decisions; solving complex problems; escalating high priority issues or risks, as appropriate; and recognizing and capitalizing on improvement opportunities.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Practices self-development and promotes learning in others by proactively providing information, resources, advice, and expertise with coworkers and customers; building relationships with cross-functional stakeholders; influencing others through technical explanations and examples; adapting to competing demands and new responsibilities; listening and responding to, seeking, and addressing performance feedback; providing feedback to others and managers; creating and executing plans to capitalize on strengths and develop weaknesses; supporting team collaboration; and adapting to and learning from change, difficulties, and feedback.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Executes the architecture process for technology solutions with guidance from senior architects as appropriate by collaborating with other architects to develop the target state.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Creates solution architectures, roadmaps, and system transition plans to align business, applications, data, integration, and/or infrastructure architecture.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Collaborates with project teams and business users to create architecture artifacts (for example, logical, conceptual, physical) to guide detailed design.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Helps determine the selection of technologies as requested.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Provides input into the development of the architecture strategy and technology direction by providing domain knowledge on solutions and technology.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Shares knowledge of current capability gaps, architectural gaps, and market and industry trends that can be used to set future direction.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Defines and communicates the architecture standards, guidelines, and statements of direction with guidance from senior architects, as appropriate, by facilitating the design and establishment of architecture standards or controls.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Ensures architecture standards or controls allow business needs to be met.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Assists in the development and establishment of architectural best practices that guide the design of technology solutions.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Collaborates with IT and business leadership and participates in making decisions regarding the adoption of new technology.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"job_duty","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Demonstrates a full understanding of the architecture best practices for assigned domain(s) and educates others throughout the organization on the function of architecture methodologies, governance, and standards by serving as a subject matter expert across business and/or IT teams, and presenting to internal and external audiences.","source_heading":"Essential Responsibilities","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"qualification","requirement_level":"required","item_text":"Minimum one (1) year in a technical leadership role with or without direct reports.","source_heading":"Minimum Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Ambiguity/Uncertainty Management","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Application Design, Architecture","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Attention to Detail","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Service Oriented Architecture (SOA)","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Business Knowledge","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"User Interface Design","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Communication","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Core)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Analytical Skills","source_heading":"Knowledge, Skills and Abilities: (Functional)","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"Criti